      "id": "claim_6cf9c01f244b4c04860dee76d38892f3",
      "statement": "All browser-initiated auth calls (login, refresh, logout) send credentials: 'include' and an X-Djimitflo-Session: browser header; the backend (packages/server/src/routes/auth.ts) uses this header to decide whether to treat the request as a cookie-eligible browser session, making it a backend-driven security boundary rather than a frontend one.",
      "evidence": [
