      "statement": "useWebSocket opens the live event connection using a WebSocket subprotocol of the form bearer.<token> instead of a query string to avoid token leakage via access logs, browser history, or Referer headers; validating this subprotocol and authenticating the token is performed by the backend WebSocket service, not the frontend.",
