      "id": "claim_970d4e6bf0fe480e8ca055ea4ada52e3",
      "statement": "useWebSocket automatically reconnects after 3 seconds on non-auth socket closes while enabled, but stops automatic reconnection on auth-related close codes (AUTH_REQUIRED, AUTH_INVALID, AUTH_EXPIRED), attempting exactly one refreshSession-then-reconnect cycle specifically for AUTH_EXPIRED via an authRefreshUsed guard.",
